        "also_known_as": [],
        "biography": "Jeremy Zag (born March 24, 1985) is a French entrepreneur and award-winning producer, director, writer, and music composer for films, television series and digital entertainment for Kid and Family, and serves as the Founder, CEO & CCO of ZAG, a global independent studio. A self-described \"kid at heart,\" Jeremy's upbringing in Paris exposed him to the worlds of art, fashion, and architecture, infusing him with an eye for design and a passion to create. Armed with a unique point of view and a gift for storytelling, Jeremy followed his dream to learn about the art of animation to begin creating series and movies inspired by American heroes and Japanese super powers.",
